---
/**
 * Privacy Policy (D121). Two parts:
 *  1. How this website handles information — written for the new site and
 *     true of it as built: no analytics, no advertising cookies, search that
 *     runs in the browser, third-party booking/forms/video/map. If analytics
 *     are added at launch, the "Collected automatically" section must change
 *     the same day.
 *  2. The clinic's SMS Messaging Data Privacy Policy, word for word from the
 *     old /privacy/ (extract/build_legal_pages.py). A carrier checks this URL
 *     when registering the texting campaign; do not reword it here.
 */
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import legal from '../data/legal-wp.json';
const sms = legal.privacy;
const a = site.address;
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" updated="Website sections updated September 2026"
           description="How East Valley Naturopathic Doctors' website handles your information, and the privacy policy for our SMS appointment messages.">
  <p>This page explains what information this website collects, what we do with it, and your
  choices. It has two parts: how the <a href="#website">website</a> handles information, and the
  privacy policy for our <a href="#sms">SMS messaging program</a>.</p>

  <p class="legal-note"><strong>Your medical records are covered separately.</strong> Health
  information you share as a patient is protected by federal law (HIPAA) and handled as described
  in our Notice of Privacy Practices, which we provide at your first visit. You can ask for a copy
  at any time by calling <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="website">This website</h2>

  <h3>Information you give us</h3>
  <p>You share information with us when you call, email, book an appointment, fill in a form or
  use the patient portal. We use it to answer you, schedule your care and run the practice.</p>
  <p>Some of these tools are run for us by other companies, which handle your information under
  their own privacy policies as well as ours:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Online booking</strong> — Acuity Scheduling and Practice Fusion (Patient Fusion).</li>
    <li><strong>Online forms</strong> — Tally.</li>
    <li><strong>Patient portal</strong> — FollowMyHealth.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Please don't send detailed medical information through general email or our contact form.
  Call us, or use the patient portal once you are a patient.</p>

  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <p>This website does not use advertising cookies or analytics tracking. If that ever changes,
  we will update this page first.</p>
  <p>Like almost every website, the servers that deliver these pages keep short-lived technical
  logs — your IP address, browser type and the pages requested — to keep the site running and
  secure.</p>
  <p>The site search runs entirely in your browser. What you type into it is not sent to us.</p>

  <h3>Embedded content from other sites</h3>
  <p>Some pages include content served by other companies: videos from YouTube (in its
  privacy-enhanced mode), a Google map on our contact page, and booking tools on some service
  pages. When that content loads or you interact with it, those companies may collect information
  under their own privacy policies.</p>

  <h3>How we use and share information</h3>
  <p>We use information to provide care, respond to you, schedule appointments and operate this
  website. <strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong> We share it only with the
  service providers above, as needed to provide care, or when the law requires it.</p>

  <h3>Children</h3>
  <p>This website is not directed at children under 13. Parents and guardians book and manage care
  for their children.</p>

  <h3>Links to other websites</h3>
  <p>Our articles link to research and other outside websites. We are not responsible for their
  content or privacy practices.</p>

  <h3>Changes to this policy</h3>
  <p>We may update this page. The date at the top shows when the website sections last changed.</p>

  <h3>Contact us</h3>
  <p>{site.name}<br />
  {a.street}, {a.city}, {a.state} {a.zip}<br />
  <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> · <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

  <h2 id="sms">SMS messaging program</h2>
  <p>This is our SMS Messaging Data Privacy Policy as published. The full program terms are on our
  <a href="/messaging-terms/">SMS Messaging Terms &amp; Conditions</a> page.</p>
  <div class="legal-verbatim" set:html={sms.html} />
</LegalPage>
